    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "City Homes are Dublin 12's local estate agents and we are delighted to offer this beautiful 3 bedroom home to the open market for sale.  Number 316 Kildare Road is an attractive and superbly well presented property and benefits from a large rear extension, 2 bathrooms and a beautifully maintained low-maintenance rear garden.\r\nThe interior accommodation comprises of an entrance hallway, a large and bright lounge room, a modern fitted kitchen, a cozy dining room, 3 good sized bedrooms and 2 bathrooms.\r\nKildare Road is a popular location and number 316 is positioned just 3.6km from Christchurch and further onto Stephens Green / Temple Bar. In the vicinity there are a host of amenities including local shops, coffee shops, bars, restaurants, parklands and supermarkets. For locations further afield the M50 motorway is just 8 minutes drive away.\r\nAdditional features include PVC double glazing to both front and rear OFCH, a large storage shed to the rear and off-street car parking for 2 cars to the front\r\n**Please note the BER grade is pending and will follow shortly**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "**please see floor plan for dimensions\r\nHall\r\n*An entrance hallway with tiled flooring\r\nLounge\r\n*A spacious lounge room with wood flooring and feature fireplace\r\nDining\r\n*A calm and cozy dining area with wood flooring and vertical radiator\r\nKitchen\r\n*A large, modern fitted kitchen with direct garden access\r\nBathroom 1\r\n*A fully tiled shower room suite positioned on the ground floor.  Triton instant electric shower\r\nBedroom 1\r\n*A double bedroom to the front with fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 2\r\n*A double bedroom to the rear with fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 3\r\n*A single bedroom to the front - currently used as a home gym but suited to a variety of purposes\r\nBathroom 2\r\n*A sleek and newly installed modern shower room suite with dual access"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A spacious 3 bedroom house (75m2 / 807ft2)\r\nExcellent condition throughout\r\n2 x bathrooms\r\nPVC double glazing\r\nOFCH with Reillo burner\r\nOff-street parking for 2 cars within a walled and paved driveway\r\nLow maintenance rear garden with patio seating area and storage shed with electricity connection\r\nA highly sought after residential setting\r\nAn abundance of amenities with a mature residential neighbourhood\r\nEasy access into the city centre / M50 just 8 minute drive away"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: Exempt"
      }
    ],
